# Repo-wide ignores. Each app (personal-home/, finance-os/) keeps its own
# .gitignore for build output and tooling; this file covers what can appear
# anywhere in the monorepo, including at the root.

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Secrets — a safety net outside the apps' own env rules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log

# Personal financial reference data (real balances — never commit)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!**/fixtures/**/*.csv
!**/__tests__/**/*.csv

# Personal finance analysis kept local: the repo is public and these docs
# carry real institutions, balances and utilization figures.
docs/PAYCHECK_PLANNER.md
